            "line": 124,
            "text": "def coordinateQ (a : ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  if hp : 0 < a ∧ a < 1 ∧ 0 < p.1 then\n    Classical.choose (exists_positive_solution hp.1 hp.2.1 hp.2.2 p.2)\n  else 1"
